      "narrative": null,
      "content": "epidemic and the need to step up action against it. The ProTEST approach to\naddressing TB/HIV was also discussed, and initial experiences with pilot ProTEST\nprojects were shared. The meeting reviewed and endorsed the WHO Strategic\nFramework to Decrease the Burden of TB/HIV.",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
